{"ID":"20240522082235-gf3d0th","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082235-gf3d0th","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082235-gf3d0th\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522102617-5h6xk03\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522102619-6gvwlqp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522102617-vhthocz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:18\u0026#125;","title":"克農氏症的再診紀錄","type":"doc","updated":"20240522102628"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522102617-5h6xk03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-5h6xk03","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三診"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-wyox17u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-wyox17u","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12/9/09 星期三"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-nxwg2v5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-nxwg2v5","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥一週，"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-bn8varx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-bn8varx","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手足皆溫；"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-ruqyxb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-ruqyxb9","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吞咽順暢；"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-0lftqlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-0lftqlh","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥時唇舌無麻；"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-cdki014","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-cdki014","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肛門口流出的膠狀物也少了許多，有兩天排出一些黑色的瘀血；"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-pgj3odh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-pgj3odh","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便仍一日6次，其中有3次成形，2次較稠，1次水利；"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-ycbac3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-ycbac3e","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他說，開始吃中藥後，他會有一種 “phantom urgency to go to the restroom.”"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-8xqx5qc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-8xqx5qc","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仔細一問，才得知，那些所謂的大便都是從小腸直接排到他那掛在右少腹的袋子裡。谷道不過是個裝飾品而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-37lo2yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-37lo2yg","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原來，切除他的大腸後，西醫本要把小腸跟直腸縫合起來。可是因為Crohn’s，他的直腸都是爛爛的，根本沒法縫合。於是就在他的小腸口接了個袋子裝排泄物……"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-fn5dg0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-fn5dg0j","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這一週來他都在懊悔，為什么沒有早兩年來這里……"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-vk11dkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-vk11dkw","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同時，他提到最近視力下降得厲害，問中藥是否可以幫助他。"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-4n27uzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-4n27uzk","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"效不更方"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-98ldj9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-98ldj9i","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-iodjlhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-iodjlhv","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同11/30/09方"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-f92rpl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-f92rpl4","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改：赤石脂三錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-jgtovfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-jgtovfn","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加：粳米三錢，決明子四錢，女貞子四錢，枸杞四錢"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-9yqlot8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-9yqlot8","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10付"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-14dfxkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-14dfxkt","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兩週後再來復診"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-vhthocz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-vhthocz","updated":"20240522102628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"草木醫師的回報2009年12月12日"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-3djh6b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-3djh6b0","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-nnkypn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-nnkypn5","updated":"20240522102624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-gjunpin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-gjunpin","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  所有西醫式的開刀治療，都是不可逆的治療，也就是說手術後再後悔已經太遲了，此人現在開始後悔已經嫌遲些，但是如果中藥將之治好後，同時直腸部份的肌肉可以長回來的話，才有機會動第二次手術，將肛門縫合住，如此才有可能將人工肛門去除，讓病人回到正常人體該有的狀態，否則此人必將終其一生都需要帶著人工肛門到處走動，想想此人也真是可憐，只因為小小的一個克農氏症，給西醫治療的結果不但沒有好轉，反而要終身帶個人工肛門，真是未蒙其利而先受其害也。所以一般我都只鼓勵我的敵人去做手術的。"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-b3ijmtu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-b3ijmtu","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  林醫師將來必是經方大師級的人物啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522102617-bks08gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102617-bks08gv","updated":"20240522102617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年12月12日"}]},{"ID":"20240522102618-8dyvtwn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522102618-8dyvtwn"}},{"ID":"20240522102619-6gvwlqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522102619-6gvwlqp"}}]}